#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 or later\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`) v0.22 або пізніше\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler with AI local mode (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit IBM Transpiler з AI локальним режимом (`pip install 'qiskit-ibm-transpiler[ai-local-mode]'`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
